  "summary": "golang-1.18, golang-1.21, golang-1.24 vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that the Go x/net/idna package incorrectly handled\ncertain Punycode-encoded labels that decoded to ASCII-only labels. An\nattacker could possibly use this issue to bypass hostname-based access\ncontrols and escalate privileges.",
